      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Median estimate for next year eps (fpi = 1) in March, divided by stock price from December. Dec fiscal year ends only, keep only forecasts more than 90 days out. Keep only below median analyst coverage each month. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.1；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=3.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=LS size adjusted。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>1。 Notes：Size adjustment and analyst coverage are both extremely important. You can see the size adjustment in Table 2.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
